<%# notification_mailer.test_admission_revoked.body_{solo,team}. No URL here,
    deliberately: the access this letter announces the end of is exactly what
    the play screen would now refuse, so a link would be a broken promise.
    See the mailer spec's "offers no play link" example. %>
<%= t("notification_mailer.test_admission_revoked.#{@team ? "body_team" : "body_solo"}",
      game_name: @game.name,
      team_name: @team&.name) %>
